WEBVTT

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:01.973
and where forests
are protected and rewilded.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.396
That's why, along with many
of my generation,

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:11.696
I'm calling on leaders
to act with speed and urgency

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:16.486
to create a future
that is fairer and healthier

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:20.153
for all people everywhere
and for our planet.

00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:22.095
Thank you.

00:01:25.846 --> 00:01:28.608
Chris Hemsworth: During
the first session a few hours ago,

00:01:28.632 --> 00:01:30.934
the UN Secretary General
mentioned an initiative